WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.093
Step by step. Advance when ready.

00:00:03.533 --> 00:00:10.267
Learn the snatch, clean and jerk in order. Position first, then movement, then speed, then weight.

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:16.631
Each step shows how to do it. And an advance when checklist, so you know you are ready.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:21.154
Mark a step done and the next one is up. Your progress is saved.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.334
Twelve steps take you from an overhead hold to a full snatch. Nine for the clean. Eight for the jerk.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.144
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
